{"4455740": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Time Before Time", "steam_appid": 4455740, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Isla Muerto!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This island has been the dream destination of many explorers such as yourself, but somethings not right here. These creatures look like weird birds mixed with reptiles. Could they be....<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4455740/extras/4d9166dc0a0e664c4a7a162caa4b693b.avif?t=1772548041\" width=1560 height=756 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dinosaurs!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are plenty of dinosaurs on this island including the gigantic Branchiosaurus, and the terrifying Spinosaurus. But the main threat isn't the dinosaurs, but the flying reptile, the Hatzegopteryx! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4455740/extras/3ca85d0b9e0267a3ee73201fbd6319d3.avif?t=1772548041\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4455740/extras_big/3ca85d0b9e0267a3ee73201fbd6319d3.webp?t=1772548041 width=1560 height=639 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game all about surviving, whether it be outsmarting the creatures or by running as fast, that is your primary goal. In The Time Before Time, you are stripped to your roots and forced to solve the mysteries of the island. Will you uncover the secrets of Isla Muerto, or will the island live up to its name?</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Isla Muerto!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This island has been the dream destination of many explorers such as yourself, but somethings not right here. These creatures look like weird birds mixed with reptiles. Could they be....<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4455740/extras/4d9166dc0a0e664c4a7a162caa4b693b.avif?t=1772548041\" width=1560 height=756 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dinosaurs!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are plenty of dinosaurs on this island including the gigantic Branchiosaurus, and the terrifying Spinosaurus. But the main threat isn't the dinosaurs, but the flying reptile, the Hatzegopteryx! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4455740/extras/3ca85d0b9e0267a3ee73201fbd6319d3.avif?t=1772548041\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4455740/extras_big/3ca85d0b9e0267a3ee73201fbd6319d3.webp?t=1772548041 width=1560 height=639 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game all about surviving, whether it be outsmarting the creatures or by running as fast, that is your primary goal. In The Time Before Time, you are stripped to your roots and forced to solve the mysteries of the island. Will you uncover the secrets of Isla Muerto, or will the island live up to its name?</p>", "short_description": "Imagine this, you are on an island all alone, when a 40 foot stork comes out of the sky. It was no bird it was the dreaded Hatzegopteryx and it will stop at nothing to hunt you down. Work hard to survive, and maybe, just maybe you will be able to escape.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4455740/67038c91720ff8a4c0cc26cc4dd8bb72c09dcb2e/header.jpg?t=1772548041", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4455740/e711c5a98bbd4091f02ce319bf1a96c5d31